Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note: Syl UI Standard Library v1.4 (Raylib FFI Bridge)
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note: Provides windowing, rendering, input, and audio primitives.
Note: Backed by Raylib 5.x via TCC/Cranelift FFI.
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Note: ─── Window Management ────────────────────────────────────

External ui InitWindow from "raylib.dll".
External ui CloseWindow from "raylib.dll".
External ui WindowShouldClose from "raylib.dll".
External ui SetTargetFPS from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Drawing Control ──────────────────────────────────────

External ui BeginDrawing from "raylib.dll".
External ui EndDrawing from "raylib.dll".
External ui ClearBackground from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Shape Rendering ──────────────────────────────────────

External ui DrawRectangle from "raylib.dll".
External ui DrawRectangleRec from "raylib.dll".
External ui DrawCircle from "raylib.dll".
External ui DrawLine from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Text Rendering ───────────────────────────────────────

External ui DrawText from "raylib.dll".
External ui DrawFPS from "raylib.dll".
External ui MeasureText from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Input: Keyboard ──────────────────────────────────────

External ui IsKeyPressed from "raylib.dll".
External ui IsKeyDown from "raylib.dll".
External ui IsKeyReleased from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Input: Mouse ─────────────────────────────────────────

External ui GetMouseX from "raylib.dll".
External ui GetMouseY from "raylib.dll".
External ui IsMouseButtonPressed from "raylib.dll".
External ui IsMouseButtonDown from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Timing ───────────────────────────────────────────────

External ui GetFrameTime from "raylib.dll".
External ui GetTime from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Audio ────────────────────────────────────────────────

External ui InitAudioDevice from "raylib.dll".
External ui CloseAudioDevice from "raylib.dll".
External ui PlaySound from "raylib.dll".

Note: ─── Color Constants (defined in Syl for convenience) ─────
Note: Colors are passed as string identifiers and resolved
Note: by the codegen to Raylib color structs:
Note:   "black", "white", "red", "green", "blue",
Note:   "yellow", "orange", "purple", "pink", "gray",
Note:   "darkgray", "lightgray", "skyblue", "gold"
